('115.14.b.4.A',2,'One way to be kind to others is to...','["brag", "tease", "share and help", "push"]'::jsonb,2,'Kindness helps people.','original'),
('115.14.b.4.B',3,'Personal growth means...','["giving up", "forgetting", "staying exactly the same", "learning and improving over time"]'::jsonb,3,'Growth is getting better.','original'),
('115.14.b.4.B',3,'Which is an area for personal growth?','["learning to read more fluently", "always winning", "never trying", "already knowing everything"]'::jsonb,0,'Growth areas are things to improve.','original'),
