('115.14.b.4.C',4,'Putting these steps in order, which comes after making a plan?','["quit", "celebrate before starting", "work on the plan", "forget the goal"]'::jsonb,2,'After planning you take action.','original'),
('115.14.b.5.A',3,'One strategy for a classmate who needs extra time to learn is to...','["ignore them", "rush them", "laugh", "be patient and kind"]'::jsonb,3,'Patience helps learners.','original'),
('115.14.b.5.A',3,'If you learn best by seeing pictures, a helpful strategy is to...','["use drawings and charts", "skip class", "close your eyes", "cover the page"]'::jsonb,0,'Visual learners use pictures.','original'),
