('115.14.b.8.B',3,'A benefit of regular physical activity is...','["a bigger backpack", "louder shoes", "a stronger heart", "a longer nap"]'::jsonb,2,'Activity strengthens the heart.','original'),
('115.14.b.9',3,'Which action helps prevent an injury at the playground?','["pushing others", "jumping from the top of slides", "playing on broken equipment", "using equipment the right way"]'::jsonb,3,'Proper use prevents falls.','original'),
('115.14.b.9',3,'Wearing a life jacket when boating helps...','["keep you afloat", "keep you dry", "make you faster", "keep you warm"]'::jsonb,0,'Life jackets save lives.','original'),
('115.14.b.9',3,'Before crossing the street you should...','["close your eyes", "stop and look both ways", "ignore cars", "run"]'::jsonb,1,'Looking prevents crashes.','original'),
('115.14.b.10.A',3,'Someone touches you in a way that feels wrong. A good refusal is to say "Stop!" and...','["go closer", "stay quiet", "go tell a trusted adult", "giggle"]'::jsonb,2,'Refuse and report.','original'),
