('115.14.b.10.B',3,'Why should you tell a trusted adult when someone crosses a personal boundary?','["so they can help protect you", "so you lose a friend", "so you hide it", "so you get in trouble"]'::jsonb,0,'Adults protect children.','original'),
('115.14.b.10.B',3,'Private parts of your body are covered by...','["your gloves", "your swimsuit", "your scarf", "your hat"]'::jsonb,1,'Swimsuit areas are private.','original'),
('115.14.b.11.A',3,'Which is an unsafe situation with a stranger?','["you play at the playground with your parent", "a teacher says hello", "a stranger asks you to help find a puppy", "your grandma waves"]'::jsonb,2,'Strangers asking for help can be a trick.','original'),
('115.14.b.11.A',3,'If a stranger offers you candy and asks you to come with them, you should...','["take the candy", "say yes", "follow them", "run away and tell a trusted adult"]'::jsonb,3,'Never go with strangers.','original'),
('115.14.b.11.B',3,'If you find an unsupervised weapon, you should...','["stay away and tell a trusted adult", "hide it", "pick it up", "show friends"]'::jsonb,0,'Weapons are dangerous.','original'),
('115.14.b.11.B',3,'Reporting an unsupervised weapon helps...','["get you a prize", "keep people safe", "make a game", "start a fight"]'::jsonb,1,'Reporting prevents harm.','original'),
('115.14.b.11.C',3,'Mishandling a gun can cause...','["a snack", "a funny joke", "serious injury or death", "a better grade"]'::jsonb,2,'Guns can kill.','original'),
('115.14.b.11.C',4,'Which is the safest thing to do with a gun you find?','["unload it yourself", "take it home", "point it as a game", "do not touch it and tell an adult"]'::jsonb,3,'Do not touch.','original'),
('115.14.b.11.D',3,'A trusted adult outside your immediate family could be...','["a neighbor or coach you know well", "someone who texts you secrets", "an online friend", "a stranger"]'::jsonb,0,'Choose adults you know in real life.','original'),
('115.14.b.11.D',3,'Having two trusted adults and their phone numbers is part of a...','["recipe", "personal safety plan", "science fair", "spelling test"]'::jsonb,1,'It tells you who to call.','original'),
('115.14.b.12.A',3,'You get a message online from someone you do not know asking for your address. You should...','["reply with your school", "send it", "not answer and tell a trusted adult", "share your password"]'::jsonb,2,'Unsafe requests should be reported.','original'),
('115.14.b.12.A',3,'Which is an unsafe online request?','["a friend sends a smiley", "a parent shares a photo", "a teacher assigns a class game", "a stranger asks you to meet in person"]'::jsonb,3,'Meeting strangers is unsafe.','original'),
('115.14.b.12.B',3,'Why should you ask an adult for help with an online problem?','["they can help you stay safe", "they cannot read", "they will take your device forever", "they will ignore you"]'::jsonb,0,'Adults guide safe choices.','original'),
('115.14.b.12.C',3,'One consequence of cyberbullying is that the victim may feel...','["excited", "hurt and lonely", "healthy", "proud"]'::jsonb,1,'Cyberbullying harms feelings.','original'),
('115.14.b.12.C',4,'Posting an unkind comment about a classmate online could lead to...','["free time", "a prize", "trouble at school or home", "a new toy"]'::jsonb,2,'Online actions have consequences.','original'),
('115.14.b.13.A',3,'A consequence for a bully may be...','["extra recess", "a new friend", "winning a trophy", "losing privileges"]'::jsonb,3,'Bullying has consequences.','original'),
('115.14.b.13.A',3,'The impact of bullying on the victim can include...','["feeling afraid and sad", "becoming faster", "growing taller", "always laughing"]'::jsonb,0,'Bullying hurts.','original'),
('115.14.b.13.B',4,'Reporting is when you tell an adult about something that...','["is just annoying", "is unsafe or harmful", "is a small mistake", "is a joke"]'::jsonb,1,'Reporting keeps people safe.','original'),
('115.14.b.13.B',4,'Tattling is when you tell on someone...','["because a rule is broken and harms others", "because someone is in danger", "just to get them in trouble", "because someone is hurt"]'::jsonb,2,'Tattling is for getting someone in trouble.','original'),
('115.14.b.13.C',3,'When bullying happens, a trusted adult can...','["ignore it", "join in", "laugh", "help stop it"]'::jsonb,3,'Adults have authority to help.','original'),
('115.14.b.13.C',3,'Why is it good to tell a parent about bullying?','["they can help solve it", "they will punish you", "they will tease you", "they will ignore it"]'::jsonb,0,'Parents can act.','original'),
('115.14.b.14.A',3,'The purpose of prescription medicine is to...','["give you candy", "treat a specific illness as ordered by a doctor", "help you sleep in class", "make you taller"]'::jsonb,1,'Prescriptions treat illness.','original'),
('115.14.b.14.A',3,'An over-the-counter medicine is often used to treat...','["a toothache only", "a broken leg", "a mild headache or cough", "nothing"]'::jsonb,2,'OTC medicines treat mild issues.','original'),
('115.14.b.14.B',4,'Alcohol harms a young person''s...','["eyes only", "fingernails only", "favorite shoes", "brain and body"]'::jsonb,3,'Alcohol harms growing bodies.','original'),
('115.14.b.14.B',3,'Vaping is harmful because it can damage the...','["lungs", "elbows", "hair", "toenails"]'::jsonb,0,'Vaping harms lungs.','original'),
('115.14.b.14.B',3,'Sniffing glue or paint fumes is harmful because it can...','["help you think", "damage the brain", "make you stronger", "taste good"]'::jsonb,1,'Inhalants harm the brain.','original'),
('115.14.b.15',3,'If a friend takes something harmful, you should...','["take some too", "keep it a secret", "get a trusted adult right away", "wait until tomorrow"]'::jsonb,2,'Fast help saves lives.','original'),
('115.14.b.15',3,'Who can help in an emergency involving a harmful substance?','["a pet", "nobody", "a stranger on the street", "911 and Poison Control"]'::jsonb,3,'Call for help.','original'),
('115.14.b.16.A',3,'Which friend request is unsafe?','["\"Try this vape with me.\"", "\"Let''s share crayons.\"", "\"Want to play tag?\"", "\"Come read with me.\""]'::jsonb,0,'Offers of drugs are unsafe.','original'),
('115.14.b.16.A',3,'A friend dares you to take a pill you do not know. This is an unsafe request about...','["math", "drugs", "colors", "games"]'::jsonb,1,'Unknown pills can harm.','original'),
('115.14.b.16.B',2,'A trusted adult could be a parent, a teacher, or a...','["pretend friend", "toy", "police officer", "stranger"]'::jsonb,2,'Law enforcement officers can help.','original'),
('115.14.b.16.B',3,'You can ask a trusted adult for help when you feel...','["sleepy", "full", "happy", "pressured to try something unsafe"]'::jsonb,3,'Adults help with pressure.','original'),
('115.14.b.17',3,'If someone offers you a drug, a refusal skill is to say no and...','["walk away", "laugh", "take it", "stay and think"]'::jsonb,0,'Leave the situation.','original'),
('115.14.b.17',3,'A strong refusal might sound like...','["\"I guess.\"", "\"No, I won''t do that.\"", "\"Maybe.\"", "\"Okay, just once.\""]'::jsonb,1,'A firm statement works best.','original')
) as v(code, diff, prompt, choices, ans, expl, src)
join public.teks_items i on i.code = v.code and i.is_standard
join public.teks_documents d on d.id = i.document_id and d.subject = 'Health Education' and d.language = 'en'
on conflict (fingerprint) do nothing;
